ash here in  jeopardy all the time  facing stage four cancer alex trebek has  chosen a path of positivity  his television appearances broke ratings  records in las vegas oh easy one who is  brian loftis  sorry and for others facing their own  great challenge  he imparts a powerful message i want to  be a positive  influence in terms of the message i send  them  and that is that hey stay the course  yes keep your chin up you never know  things have a way of turning quickly in  in relation to cancer one week from now  they may have a cure and maybe the  miracle  is in the message in addition to  entertaining us for nearly four decades  alex trebek also showed us how to face  adversity  with perspective humor and consistent  courage  trebek's final 35 episodes will air as  they were shot  you can see them right here on channel 8  weeknights at 7 00.  the jeopardy team has always been so  kind to us and we at eight news now  extend  our deepest sympathies to all of them  denise kirsten  truly alex trebek one of a kind yes  indeed and i believe he worked up until  a week and a half ago didn't he  such strength such courage really  incredible the way he's lived the last  year and a half  with this and so inspiring to so many as  cancer has really touched all of our  families in some way  right he was so brave i mean to continue  to working to what 10 days ago  wow good for him we're going to miss him  for sure we certainly are
 

